# Developer Tool Config Files
.cpcache
.DS_Store
.nrepl-port
.rebel_readline_history
.vscode
.clj-kondo/*
!.clj-kondo/config.edn

# Build Directories and Files
/.key
/logs
# target/ must EXIST at JVM start: deps.edn lists it in :paths, and a
# classpath entry that is absent when the JVM boots stays dead for the life of
# the process. On a fresh clone that makes every page 500 with
# "Cannot open <nil> as a Reader" from triangulum.views/find-cljs-app-js,
# because target/public/cljs/manifest.edn is unreachable even after figwheel
# writes it. Track the directory, ignore its contents.
/target/*
!/target/.gitkeep
/deps-for-clj-watson.edn

# Configuration files
/config.edn
announcement.txt
/resources/runway.pkcs12
/resources/keys/
/.clj-kondo
.lsp/*
/node_modules/
